%% IPTV Hub — Per-app update state machine

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> idle : seed_from_folder / add_app

    idle --> checking : poll_tick / sync_now
    checking --> up_to_date : remote SHA == local SHA
    checking --> update_available : remote SHA != local SHA
    checking --> error : network / git / api failure

    up_to_date --> checking : poll_tick
    update_available --> planning : user clicks Update
    planning --> awaiting_confirm : plan produced
    awaiting_confirm --> updating : user clicks Apply
    awaiting_confirm --> update_available : user clicks Cancel

    updating --> snapshotting : step 1
    snapshotting --> fetching : snapshot complete
    fetching --> verifying : artifact downloaded
    verifying --> swapping : sha256 ok
    swapping --> relinking : swap done
    relinking --> smoking : symlinks restored
    smoking --> healthy : smoke pass
    smoking --> rolling_back : smoke fail

    snapshotting --> rolling_back : io error
    fetching --> rolling_back : net error after retry
    verifying --> rolling_back : sha mismatch
    swapping --> rolling_back : io error
    relinking --> rolling_back : symlink error

    rolling_back --> up_to_date : rollback ok
    rolling_back --> error : rollback failed (manual recovery)

    healthy --> up_to_date : commit step
    error --> checking : poll_tick (after backoff)
    error --> updating : user clicks Retry

    up_to_date --> running : user clicks Launch
    update_available --> running : user clicks Launch
    healthy --> running : user clicks Launch
    running --> up_to_date : app exits (last_known: ok)
    running --> error : app crash / non-zero exit
